       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you continue to enjoy 『NEEDY STREAMER OVERLOAD』",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bless.",
